# Policy record for P0-M1-T04 (contributor rules decision). Mirrors
# docs/layout.md: one owner row per Cargo workspace workstream plus the
# governance directories, and a catch-all default so nothing falls between
# rows. Rules are Gitea regexp patterns (golang regexp); last match for a file
# wins, and rules are composable across a multi-path pull request.
#
# Wave 1 is single-maintainer: @don owns every row today. Rows are
# forward-declared so a workstream lead slots in as a one-line owner edit.
# Refinement and sync with docs/layout.md lands under P13-T01.
#
# Rows track the Cargo workspace member list (INTEGRATION-T02 forward-ported
# oep-step-pmi / oep-pmi / oep-qif rows in with the P4 lane).

